{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Chord: The Loudest Hero",
    "steam_appid": 3622610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/beef903b9b83f9b1d09949c902f36a1a.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tone-deaf Dark Lord &quot;Discord&quot; has stolen the Melody!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With music gone, the kingdom of Meloria has fallen into silence \u2014 and now, your voice is <strong>the only hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/81fdd3f13ac537c0dfeff06334a62a24.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a <strong>voice-controlled puzzle adventure game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sing, shout, whisper</strong> \u2014 your voice change the world!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles react to the <strong>Pitch, Volume, and Rhythm of your voice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your voice</strong> to battle monsters and break through obstacles standing in your way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>music-themed bosses</strong> and defeat them using a variety of <strong>voice-based skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/2d9c3e1e3244385ec32b76980601a7a9.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span>Become the hero of Meloria with <strong>the power of your voice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t have to be a great singer \u2014 here, In this world, a heartfelt voice is the strongest weapon of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is currently in demo version.<br>At this time, only Chapter 1 is available, and certain areas may not run as smoothly as intended.<br>We\u2019re actively working to improve the experience, and we truly appreciate your patience and understanding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your feedback is always welcome.<br>Thank you so much for playing! :)</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/beef903b9b83f9b1d09949c902f36a1a.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tone-deaf Dark Lord &quot;Discord&quot; has stolen the Melody!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With music gone, the kingdom of Meloria has fallen into silence \u2014 and now, your voice is <strong>the only hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/81fdd3f13ac537c0dfeff06334a62a24.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a <strong>voice-controlled puzzle adventure game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sing, shout, whisper</strong> \u2014 your voice change the world!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles react to the <strong>Pitch, Volume, and Rhythm of your voice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your voice</strong> to battle monsters and break through obstacles standing in your way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>music-themed bosses</strong> and defeat them using a variety of <strong>voice-based skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/2d9c3e1e3244385ec32b76980601a7a9.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span>Become the hero of Meloria with <strong>the power of your voice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t have to be a great singer \u2014 here, In this world, a heartfelt voice is the strongest weapon of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is currently in demo version.<br>At this time, only Chapter 1 is available, and certain areas may not run as smoothly as intended.<br>We\u2019re actively working to improve the experience, and we truly appreciate your patience and understanding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your feedback is always welcome.<br>Thank you so much for playing! :)</i></p>",
    "short_description": "The fairytale kingdom of Meloria has been swallowed by darkness. Only your voice can solve the puzzles, overcome the obstacles, and save the kingdom! A magical puzzle-action adventure where the world transforms in response to your cries. Can you become the true hero of this fairytale?",
